{
 "about": "Default 32-entry binding tables and axis state of a joystick device record (spec 6.4). binding32[i]: i 0..15 = button i, 16+4p+d = POV p direction d (d: 0 down, 1 up, 2 left, 3 right); value = action id, 0 = none. Generic cases evaluated with the static rules (analyst model); known_devices transcribed from the executable (static). Axis ids are byte offsets into the DirectInput joystick state (0 X, 4 Y, 8 Z, 12 Rx, 16 Ry, 20 Rz, 24 slider 0, 28 slider 1). Known-device tables replace binding32[0..19] and leave 20..31 = 0.",
